    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22275" root="شرى" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرَوِىٌّ</span></b> , in which the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span> is a substitute for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span>,
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرَائِىٌّ</span></b> , [both signifying <i>Of,</i> or <i>relating to,
selling,</i> and also <i>of,</i> or <i>relating to, buying,</i>] are
rel. ns.; the former, of the inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرًى</span>; and the
latter, of the inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرَآءٌ</span>. (Msb, TA.)

